window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>When I entered this competition, I never thought there would be so much at stake. Not only is my poor little battered heart on the line, but so is my life.<br> <br> As the dreaded family visits continue, more devastating secrets are revealed. And one changes everything.<br> <br> I’m only just recovering from the shock when it’s time for another elimination, and this one proves to be the hardest of all.<br> <br> Broken and torn apart, I’m forced to move on to the worst part of this entire competition: introducing the remaining bachelors to <i>my</i> crazy family. This should go well…<br> <br> With only two bachelors left, my heart is hopelessly divided. How will I ever be able to choose the one?</p> <p><b>One click above to listen to the epic finale of this steamy and thrilling enemies to lovers, new adult paranormal romance full of tension, mystery, and intrigue in one human-ish woman’s search for true love ♥</b></p> <p><i>***Author's note: Savage Love is an ADULT dark paranormal romance with some dark themes, possessive males, and adult language. It was originally published on Kindle Vella as Hitched Live. It is set within the world of Azar, along with (in listening order) Hitched, Darkblood Academy, Royally Hitched, Darkblood Prison, Wolfish, Vampish and Of Gods and Wolves, but it's not necessary to listen to the other series first to enjoy this one.</i><br> <br> The Hitched Live Series (Season One - Aspen's Story)<br> Sweet Revenge<br> Wicked Games<br> Savage Love<br> <br> The Hitched Live Series (Season Two)<br> Sweet Temptation<br> Dark Desire<br> True Love</p>"; 
